word"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncbroadcastsequence","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An async sequence that multicasts elements from an upstream sequence to multiple concurrent consumers."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent":{"url":"\/documentation\/afluent","abstract":[],"type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","kind":"symbol","title":"Afluent"}}}